        },
        {
            "block_label": "paragraph_title",
            "block_content": "Interruptions",
            "block_bbox": [
                92,
                189,
                241,
                215
            ],
            "block_id": 3,
            "block_order": 2,
            "group_id": 3,
            "global_block_id": 3,
            "global_group_id": 3,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    92.0,
                    189.0
                ],
                [
                    241.0,
                    189.0
                ],
                [
                    241.0,
                    215.0
                ],
                [
                    92.0,
                    215.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "When you interrupt a subject-verb or verb-object, you make it harder for readers to make the basic grammatical connections that create a sentence. So in general, avoid such interruptions, except for reasons of emphasis or nuance (see pp. 129–130).",
            "block_bbox": [
                90,
                223,
                784,
                324
            ],
            "block_id": 4,
            "block_order": 3,
            "group_id": 4,
            "global_block_id": 4,
            "global_group_id": 4,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    90.0,
                    223.0
                ],
                [
                    784.0,
                    223.0
                ],
                [
                    784.0,
                    324.0
                ],
                [
                    90.0,
                    324.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "If you must interrupt a subject and verb or verb and object with more than a few words, always put paired commas around the interruption.",
            "block_bbox": [
                91,
                328,
                782,
                378
            ],
            "block_id": 5,
            "block_order": 4,
            "group_id": 5,
            "global_block_id": 5,
            "global_group_id": 5,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    91.0,
                    328.0
                ],
                [
                    782.0,
                    328.0
                ],
                [
                    782.0,
                    378.0
                ],
                [
                    91.0,
                    378.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "☑ A sentence if it includes subordinate clauses, may seem to need commas.",
            "block_bbox": [
                88,
                390,
                718,
                414
            ],
            "block_id": 6,
            "block_order": 5,
            "group_id": 6,
            "global_block_id": 6,
            "global_group_id": 6,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    93.0,
                    390.0
                ],
                [
                    717.0,
                    390.0
                ],
                [
                    717.0,
                    413.0
                ],
                [
                    93.0,
                    413.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Generally speaking, do not use a comma when you tack on a subordinate clause at the end of an independent clause if that subordinate clause is necessary to understand the meaning of the sentence (this is analogous to a restrictive relative clause):",
            "block_bbox": [
                90,
                430,
                784,
                531
            ],
            "block_id": 7,
            "block_order": 6,
            "group_id": 7,
            "global_block_id": 7,
            "global_group_id": 7,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    90.0,
                    430.0
                ],
                [
                    784.0,
                    430.0
                ],
                [
                    784.0,
                    531.0
                ],
                [
                    90.0,
                    531.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "No one should violate the law just because it seems unjust.",
            "block_bbox": [
                90,
                544,
                602,
                568
            ],
            "block_id": 8,
            "block_order": 7,
            "group_id": 8,
            "global_block_id": 8,
            "global_group_id": 8,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    90.0,
                    544.0
                ],
                [
                    602.0,
                    544.0
                ],
                [
                    602.0,
                    568.0
                ],
                [
                    90.0,
                    568.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "If the clause is not necessary, separate it from the main clause with a comma (this is analogous to a nonrestrictive relative clause).",
            "block_bbox": [
                90,
                583,
                783,
                634
            ],
            "block_id": 9,
            "block_order": 8,
            "group_id": 9,
            "global_block_id": 9,
            "global_group_id": 9,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    90.0,
                    583.0
                ],
                [
                    783.0,
                    583.0
                ],
                [
                    783.0,
                    634.0
                ],
                [
                    90.0,
                    634.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "No one should violate the law because in the long run it will do more harm than good.",
            "block_bbox": [
                90,
                646,
                767,
                670
            ],
            "block_id": 10,
            "block_order": 9,
            "group_id": 10,
            "global_block_id": 10,
            "global_group_id": 10,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    90.0,
                    646.0
                ],
                [
                    767.0,
                    646.0
                ],
                [
                    767.0,
                    670.0
                ],
                [
                    90.0,
                    670.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "This distinction can be tricky at times, and some editors and teachers regard a comma before a subordinating conjunction as an error rather than an option.",
            "block_bbox": [
                91,
                685,
                783,
                735
            ],
            "block_id": 11,
            "block_order": 10,
            "group_id": 11,
            "global_block_id": 11,
            "global_group_id": 11,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    91.0,
                    685.0
                ],
                [
                    783.0,
                    685.0
                ],
                [
                    783.0,
                    735.0
                ],
                [
                    91.0,
                    735.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "You may locate adverbial phrases before, after, or in the middle of a clause, depending on the emphasis you want readers to hear. If in the middle, put a comma before and after. Compare the different emphases in these:",
            "block_bbox": [
                90,
                737,
                784,
                814
            ],
            "block_id": 12,
            "block_order": 11,
            "group_id": 12,
            "global_block_id": 12,
            "global_group_id": 12,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    90.0,
